 - `goal.complete() -> dict`: mark goal as completed and get final goal status
 
+## Todo
+
+A per-session todo list for multi-step work. It is saved in the session and follows forks; the user sees it with /todos.
+
+- `todo.add(text: str) -> dict`: add an open item; returns its `id` and the whole list
+- `todo.toggle(id: int) -> dict`: mark an item done, or open again
+- `todo.list() -> dict`: the list as `{items, text}`
+- `todo.clear() -> dict`: remove every item
+
 ## Heartbeat
 
 In prime-agent, agents can create heartbeats to wake themselves up after a given period of time with remembered instructions, recurrently on a given schedule.
