@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+---
+name: todo
+description: Keep a todo list for multi-step work in this session. The list is saved in the session, follows forks and resumes, and the user sees it with /todos. Use it to plan steps, tick them off and show what is left.
+---
+
+# todo
+
+```python
+import todo
+
+await todo.add("write the failing test")   # {"id": 1, "items": [...], "text": "[ ] 1 write the failing test"}
+await todo.toggle(1)                       # marks item 1 done, or open again
+await todo.list()                          # {"items": [{"id", "text", "done"}], "text": ...}
+await todo.clear()                         # empties the list
+```
+
+Each call returns the whole list. Ids start at 1 and stay stable until `clear()`.
